        "required": false,
        "multiple": true
      },
      {
        "structure": "Heading4",
        "description": "四级标题，概括细分内容的短语，通常3-15字，不含完整句子结构。",
        "required": false,
        "multiple": true
      },
      {
        "structure": "Heading5",
